    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffPreProd` is the pre-production environment module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for pre-production configuration and server composition before production rollout. Server-specific runtime settings belong in child server modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Pre-production configuration should mirror production intent while preserving clear override boundaries and safe testing controls."
    }
